query:
`sqlparse.split` no longer ends a stored procedure that contains a while-loop: every statement after it is merged into the procedure.

```python
import sqlparse

script = """\
CREATE PROCEDURE countdown(IN n INT)
BEGIN
  WHILE n > 0 DO
    SET n = n - 1;
  END WHILE;
END;
SELECT 1;
SELECT 2;"""
